<title>USA: Muscatine, Iowa, won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Muscatine, Iowa, won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.735 million of Muscatine, Iowa, general obligation corporate purpose bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.84 percent.</p>
</text>
